  - m_Id: 32
    m_Localized: Visit to an Infected Relative
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33
    m_Localized: Serum of Calm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34
    m_Localized: Reduces the morality of all players by 10 points.\n+5 Morale\n+1
      Corruption for all players\n+1 poison for all players
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35
    m_Localized: The target loses the ability to vote for 1 turn.\n+10 Morale\n+1
      poison for the target
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36
    m_Localized: Poisons a player, adding +3 poison markers.\n+15 Morale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37
    m_Localized: The target cannot vote in the next round.\n+10 Morale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38
    m_Localized: Paralyzes a player for 1 turn, unable to perform any action.\n+5
      Morale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39
    m_Localized: Reduces a player's morality by 15 points.\n+5 Morale\n+1 Corruption
      for the target\n+1 poison for the target
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40
    m_Localized: Adds +1 Corruption to all players.\n+10 Morale\n+1 poison for all
      players
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41
    m_Localized: Paralyzes two players in the next turn.\n+10 Morale\n+1 Corruption
      for the target\n+1 poison for the targets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42
    m_Localized: Forces the target's vote to be the same as yours.\n+5 Morale\n+1
      poison for the target
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43
    m_Localized: Silences a player this turn.\n+10 Morale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44
    m_Localized: Removes 2 Corruption markers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45
    m_Localized: Removes 1 poison marker from all players.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46
    m_Localized: Grants immunity to poison for the player who uses it, for 2 turns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47
    m_Localized: Removes 3 poison markers from a target player.\n-5 Influence\n+10
      Morale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48
    m_Localized: Removes all poison markers from a player and increases the target's
      Morale by 5 points.\n-10 Influence\n+10 Morale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49
    m_Localized: Removes 1 poison marker and increases the target's Morale by 10
      points.\nSilences for 1 turn\n+5 Influence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50
    m_Localized: Skips the vote this round and reduces 1 poison marker from all players.\n-10
      Influence\n+10 Morale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51
    m_Localized: Nullifies all debuffs on the target and reduces 1 Corruption from
      the target.\n+5 Morale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52
    m_Localized: Removes 2 poison markers from a player and grants immunity to poison
      for 1 turn.\n+10 Morale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53
    m_Localized: Removes 1 poison marker from all players and increases everyone's
      Morale by 5 points.\n-5 Morale\n+10 Influence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54
    m_Localized: Reduces 4 poison markers and grants immunity to a player for the
      next 2 turns.\n-5 Morale\n+10 Influence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55
    m_Localized: Reduces 1 poison marker from all players.\nSilences in the next
      turn\n+5 Morale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56
    m_Localized: Removes 1 poison marker from the target and grants immunity to poison
      for 2 turns.\n+1 Corruption to the target\n+5 Influence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57
    m_Localized: 'Option 1: +10 Influence +10 Morale -1 Corruption\nOption 2: +5
      Influence, +15 Morale, +1 Corruption'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58
    m_Localized: 'Option 1: +10 Morale +5 Influence\nOption 2: +5 Influence +15 Morale
      +1 Corruption'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59
    m_Localized: 'Option 1: +20 Influence +1 Corruption\nOption 2: +15 Morale -1
      Corruption'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60
    m_Localized: 'Option 1: +5 Influence -2 Poison\nOption 2: +10 Morale -1 Corruption'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61
    m_Localized: 'Option 1: +10 Influence +15 Morale\nOption 2: +5 Influence +20
      Morale +1 Corruption'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62
    m_Localized: 'Option 1: +15 Influence +5 Morale -1 Corruption\nOption 2: +5 Influence
      +25 Morale +1 Corruption'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63
    m_Localized: 'Option 1: +10 Influence +1 Corruption\nOption 2: +15 Morale -1
      Corruption'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64
    m_Localized: 'Option 1: +15 Morale +5 Influence +1 Poison for you\nOption 2:
      +10 Morale +5 Influence +1 Corruption'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65
    m_Localized: 'Option 1: +10 Influence +5 Morale +2 Poison\nOption 2: +5 Influence
      +15 Morale'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66
    m_Localized: 'Option 1: +5 Morale -2 Poison\nOption 2: +10 Morale -1 Corruption'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67
    m_Localized: A potion that, when dispersed, causes confusion and distrust among
      players, weakening their alliances.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 68
    m_Localized: Made with rare mushrooms, this potion clouds the mind and leaves
      the target vulnerable, unable to distinguish truth from lies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69
    m_Localized: Extracted from a poisonous flower, this potion induces subtle and
      deadly fevers that slowly corrode vitality.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70
    m_Localized: Made with herbs that induce drowsiness, this elixir causes the target
      to miss the next voting round, rendering them unable to vote.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71
    m_Localized: A black vial that, when ingested, triggers intense and paralyzing
      pain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72
    m_Localized: A substance that causes deep sadness and loss of hope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73
    m_Localized: A substance that causes a subtle shift in players' perception, making
      them more prone to corruption.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74
    m_Localized: A potion made from rare and dark herbs that, when inhaled, dulls
      the senses and makes movements heavy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75
    m_Localized: Created with hallucinogenic herbs from the new continent, used in
      wedding and honeymoon rituals, it makes the target infatuated with you and
      agree with everything said by their \lover\"."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76
    m_Localized: Created from spores of a mushroom found in the east, it primarily
      affects the throat and respiratory system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77
    m_Localized: An enchanted amulet, created by ancient healers, that protects against
      Corruption. Its light shines brightly as it absorbs the evils of the heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78
    m_Localized: A vial containing a crystalline solution, created from rare herbs
      and pure waters. When used, it revitalizes the spirit and removes toxins from
      the body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79
    m_Localized: A vibrant potion that strengthens the body and mind, creating a
      temporary barrier against the harmful effects of poison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80
    m_Localized: A rare and expensive balm that significantly alleviates the suffering
      of a specific patient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 81
    m_Localized: A popular remedy used to quickly purge poisons and toxins from the
      body, but at a cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82
    m_Localized: A calming tea, prepared with rare herbs, that purifies the mind
      and body, restoring peace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83
    m_Localized: An isolated room where the sick can rest, avoiding contamination
      of others.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84
    m_Localized: A rare mixture, composed of purifying roots and leaves, that clarifies
      the mind and body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85
    m_Localized: A valuable tonic that restores vitality and temporarily immunizes
      against the plague.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86
    m_Localized: A mixture of purifying herbs prepared to expel impurities from the
      body and restore peace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87
    m_Localized: A calming oil, applied to the skin to reduce the impact of poisons
      and give resistance to the patient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88
    m_Localized: A revitalizing elixir that Victorian doctors use to strengthen the
      body against diseases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89
    m_Localized: A bold and risky injection that promises temporary immunity, but
      with possible side effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90
    m_Localized: You have access to a small reserve of potable water. Many residents
      need it to survive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91
    m_Localized: Amid food scarcity, you found a small supply that could feed your
      family for a few days. However, your neighbor is on the brink of starvation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92
    m_Localized: The famous alchemist Arvid offers you the lucrative opportunity
      to sell fake potions to the residents. The offer is tempting, but you'll have
      to deceive the community.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93
    m_Localized: You find a rare amulet that soothes the plague. You can use it to
      heal yourself or offer it to an ally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94
    m_Localized: Several inhabitants are rapidly falling ill. Would you volunteer
      to care for the sick, even at risk?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95
    m_Localized: You have a limited amount of plague remedies. You could distribute
      them fairly among those in need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96
    m_Localized: You find a book with important information about the plague. You
      can study it alone or share it with others.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97
    m_Localized: You obtained a mask that protects against infection. A friend without
      a mask is getting sicker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 98
    m_Localized: A close relative has been infected by the plague and is isolated.
      You have the choice to visit them, risking infection, or protect yourself and
      avoid contact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 99
    m_Localized: A serum that reduces poison and Corruption. You can benefit from
      it or donate it so an ally can protect themselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100
    m_Localized: Distribute the water to the community.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101
    m_Localized: Share the food with your neighbor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102
    m_Localized: Accept Arvid's offer and sell the fake potions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103
    m_Localized: Use the amulet to heal yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104
    m_Localized: Help the sick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 105
    m_Localized: Distribute equally among the needy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106
    m_Localized: Keep the knowledge to yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 107
    m_Localized: Give your mask to the friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108
    m_Localized: Visit the relative and comfort them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109
    m_Localized: Use the serum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 110
    m_Localized: Keep the water for yourself and your family.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 111
    m_Localized: Keep everything for yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112
    m_Localized: Refuse the offer and denounce Arvid to the residents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 113
    m_Localized: Offer the amulet to a sicker ally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 114
    m_Localized: Protect yourself and avoid contact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115
    m_Localized: Keep a larger portion for yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 116
    m_Localized: Share the knowledge with others.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 117
    m_Localized: Use the mask and protect yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 118
    m_Localized: Stay safe and avoid contact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 119
    m_Localized: Offer it to an ally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
